# Trivy ignore list — CVEs reviewed and accepted as non-exploitable in this
# deployment's actual architecture. See smartcart-ai-service/.trivyignore for
# the AI microservice's equivalent list.
# Re-review each entry periodically in case an upstream fix becomes available.

# libexpat (eclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine base image): integer overflow in
# XML parsing. This Spring Boot service has no XML config or XML parsing in
# its own code (properties-based config, JSON over REST); the JVM's own XML
# support uses its bundled Xerces implementation, not the system libexpat C
# library, so this is never on a reachable code path.
CVE-2026-56408

# p11-kit / p11-kit-trust (eclipse-temurin:17-jre-alpine base image): NULL
# dereference via C_DeriveKey with a PKCS#11 module. This service never
# configures a PKCS11 keystore provider or otherwise touches p11-kit; the
# JVM uses its own default cacerts trust store.
CVE-2026-2100